IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAY0002.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    05 WS-UNI             PIC X.
    05 WS-GRSP            PIC 9(7)V99.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 U-DU               PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM DUES-RULES
    DISPLAY "U-DU=" U-DU
    STOP RUN.
DUES-RULES.
    IF WS-UNI EQUAL TO 'Y'
        IF WS-GRSP NOT < 2000
            MOVE 45 TO U-DU
        ELSE
            MOVE 25 TO U-DU
        END-IF
    ELSE
        MOVE 0 TO U-DU
    END-IF.
